```text
```

#### stderr
compare: "lf"

```text
PyException JSONDecodeError: Expecting property name enclosed in double quotes: line 1 column 2 (char 1)
```

### Notes

The real `json.JSONDecodeError` from `loads("{")` escapes: AV ends in the
language-error terminal state with no success value and no partial output;
the A2PY process exits 1. Both ends classify it `python.10` — the frozen
class table matches the exact type name, and `JSONDecodeError` is not in it
(it is a `ValueError` subclass but is NOT mapped to class 5). `[50,60)` is
the byte range of `loads("{")`.
